(S, "Who led the enemy forces against the Muslims in the Battle of Yamama?", ["Musailima", "Abu Jahl", "Abu Sufyan", "Khalid bin Waleed"], 0, "Musailima the Liar claimed to be a prophet and was defeated and killed at the Battle of Yamama in 632 CE under Khalid bin Waleed.", "The battle took place in the caliphate of Hazrat Abu Bakr (RA).", [2525]),
