(S, "In which year did Allama Iqbal preside over the Allahabad session of the All India Muslim League?", ["1906", "1930", "1933", "1940"], 1, "Allama Iqbal gave his presidential address at Allahabad in December 1930, presenting the idea of a separate Muslim state in the north-west.", "The Lahore Resolution followed in 1940.", [2686]),
