(S, "What is the legislature of Pakistan called?", ["Majlis-e-Shura (Parliament)", "Jirga", "Lok Sabha", "Majlis-e-Amal"], 0, "Pakistan's federal legislature is the Majlis-e-Shura (Parliament), made up of the President, the National Assembly and the Senate.", "India's lower house is called the Lok Sabha.", [3699, 3700, 605]),
