(S, "On which date was the Liaquat-Nehru Pact signed?", ["8 April 1950", "10 January 1966", "2 July 1972", "15 August 1947"], 0, "The Liaquat-Nehru (Delhi) Pact was signed on 8 April 1950 by Liaquat Ali Khan and Jawaharlal Nehru to protect minorities in both countries.", "It is also called the Delhi Pact.", [968, 2753, 24]),
